{"title": "List of Bosses", "pageid": 40878, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/List_of_Bosses", "categories": ["Lists", "Bosses", "Characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the concept of bosses and what makes a character a boss, see <a href=\"/wiki/Bosses\" title=\"Bosses\">Bosses</a></div>\n<p><b>Bosses</b> are a special type of character in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. The informal term <i>Boss</i> is used by the community to describe those NPCs, but is not mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/Quests\" title=\"Quests\">Quests</a> or in the Journal. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bosses\">Bosses</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Prologue\">Prologue</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines center\" style=\"max-width: 894px;margin:0 auto;\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 145px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 140px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zhalk\" title=\"Commander Zhalk* Cambion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Zhalk.png/140px-Portrait_Zhalk.png.webp, /w/images/4/44/Portrait_Zhalk.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Zhalk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Zhalk.png/140px-Portrait_Zhalk.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Zhalk.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Commander_Zhalk\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commander Zhalk\">Commander Zhalk</a></big><sup>*</sup><br><a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">Cambion</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines center\" style=\"max-width: 894px;margin:0 auto;\"